class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="c1"># Code snippets and LaTeX math ($$ \mathcal{L}_{\text{DPO}} $$) still work seamlessly when needed
</span><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">reflect</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">idea</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="nb">str</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">-&gt;</span> <span class="nb">str</span><span class="p">:</span>
    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">idea</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">strip</span><span class="p">()</span>
</code></pre></div></div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="technology"/><category term="essays"/><category term="llm"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[A clean template for essays, technical deep-dives, reading notes, or personal reflections.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Phronetic AI</title><link href="https://shivprasadsagare.github.io/blog/2024/phronetic-ai/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Phronetic AI"/><published>2024-07-08T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2024-07-08T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://shivprasadsagare.github.io/blog/2024/phronetic-ai</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://shivprasadsagare.github.io/blog/2024/phronetic-ai/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author></entry><entry><title type="html">Phronetic AI</title><link href="https://shivprasadsagare.github.io/blog/2024/phronetic-ai/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Phronetic AI"/><published>2024-06-28T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2024-06-28T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://shivprasadsagare.github.io/blog/2024/phronetic-ai</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://shivprasadsagare.github.io/blog/2024/phronetic-ai/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author></entry><entry><title type="html">Phronetic AI</title><link href="https://shivprasadsagare.github.io/blog/2024/phronetic-ai/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Phronetic AI"/><published>2024-06-07T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2024-06-07T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://shivprasadsagare.github.io/blog/2024/phronetic-ai</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://shivprasadsagare.github.io/blog/2024/phronetic-ai/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author></entry></feed>